# Vercel hosts only the static frontend (frontend/). The FastAPI backend runs on Render (Docker), and /api is
# proxied there by the rewrite in vercel.json. Keep backend code, data and Python manifests out of Vercel builds so
# they are never detected or deployed as serverless functions.
app/
tests/
benchmarks/
migrations/
tools/
docs/
data/
uploads/
*.db
requirements*.txt
Dockerfile
render.yaml
alembic.ini
.github/
